      "description": "Slippery Rock University | Assistant Baseball Coach  - Full Time Permanent Skip to Main Content STUDENTS FACULTY AND STAFF ADMINISTRATION ALUMNI, FRIENDS, GIVING PARENTS ADMISSIONS ACADEMICS CAMPUS LIFE ATHLETICS ABOUT SRU NEWS and INFO Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help About SRU Human Resources Diversity and Equal Opportunity Benefits Directions Visitors and Community Assistant Baseball Coach  - Full Time Permanent Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link.  If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Must provide contact information for three current professional references within your application materials. Full consideration given to applications received by November 1, 2026. Official transcripts will be required from the recommended candidate before hiring for position. Recommended candidate will be required to complete criminal background checks, including Act 34 (State Police) background check, Act 151 (Child Abuse) background check, and Federal Criminal (FBI) clearance prior to appointment. Slippery Rock University is unable to offer sponsorship for this position. Posting Details Position Details Posting Number N01239 Classification Title Assistant Baseball Coach Working Title Assistant Baseball Coach  - Full Time Permanent Employee Group Coaches Bargaining Unit Coaches Location Main Campus Department Athletics Pay Rate $42,500 Employment Type Regular FT Work Schedule As required to complete the job of full-time assistant baseball coach Position Summary Information Position Summary Assist head coach with organization and supervision of the baseball program including: recruitment of qualified student-athletes with a commitment to academic success; compliance with NCAA , PSAC , and SRU rules and regulations; coaching and teaching both instructional skills and team concepts; counseling and mentoring student-athletes throughout the academic year; scouting; budgeting management; fundraising activities and promotions; organizing and directing camps and clinics; and other duties as assigned. Minimum Qualifications Bachelor’s degree; successful collegiate baseball coaching experience or two years of High School baseball coaching experience; working with diverse populations; and successful performance in an interview. Preferred Qualifications Pitching background and professional experience; Master’s Degree; preferably two years coaching experience at the collegiate level. Experience with the PSAC . Ability to show successful recruiting track record and experience. Posting Detail Information Posting Date 10/20/2026 Closing Date Open Until Filled No Notice of Non-Discrimination Slippery Rock University is committed to a policy of affirmative action. Slippery Rock University assures an equal opportunity to all persons without regard to race, color, religion, creed, disability, ancestry, national origin, age, gender or veteran’s status in accordance with state and federal laws, including Title VI of the Civil Rights Act of 1964, Title IX of the Education Amendments of 1972 and Section 504 of the Rehabilitation Act of 1973. Respect for Individuals in the Community Slippery Rock University provides an environment that respects, encourages, and promotes the talents and contributions of all. Slippery Rock University values a community with a shared sense of purpose, where people demonstrate mutual respect and appreciation. Slippery Rock University values diversity that honors and includes all pe